        <mxCell id="p2-cdr-nocall-explain" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#666666;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 8px;&quot;&gt;Athena / Glue / S3 / Lake Formation — &lt;b&gt;idle during a session&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top: 6px; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Every fact CVX needs from these products was materialized to AgentCore Memory in Phase 1. Re-querying here would waste cross-account roundtrips and add 100–300 ms per turn for no new information.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="p2-cdr-nocall">
