        <!-- Phase 2 footer note -->
        <mxCell id="p2-footer-note" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Invariant enforced by Phase 2:&lt;/b&gt; the hot path never crosses to the ADP Centralized Data Repository. Reads route to AgentCore Memory (fast) or Bedrock KB (governed reference). CMS writes (book, escalate) stay in-region. This is why an N-turn session pays the ~6s Athena cost &lt;b&gt;once&lt;/b&gt;, not &lt;b&gt;N times&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B2EBF2;strokeColor=#00838F;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#004D40;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=15;spacingRight=15;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="phase2-band">
